OL,3,GNEWSAPatient reused syringe as NHS
OL,4,Asupplies failed to arrive
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man says he was left for hours in
OL,7,Facute pain because a private healthcare
OL,8,Fcompany providing NHS community
OL,9,Fservices failed to deliver the syringes
OL,10,Fhe needed to administer medication.
OL,12,FThe 55-year-old from Swindon,
OL,13,FWiltshire, who does not want to be
OL,14,Fnamed, has chronic pancreatitis
OL,15,Ffollowing surgery for pancreatic
OL,16,Fcancer.
OL,18,FHe said he became so concerned about
OL,19,Frunning out of equipment on one
OL,20,Foccasion that he disinfected and reused
OL,21,Fa syringe.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
