OL,3,GNEWSAPatient reused syringe as NHS
OL,4,Asupplies failed to arrive
OL,5,
OL,6,FHCRG Care Group, which provides
OL,7,Fcommunity health services across
OL,8,FWiltshire and Bath and North East
OL,9,FSomerset, said: "We do not discuss
OL,10,Findividual patients' treatment
OL,11,Fpublicly. Concerns about their care are
OL,12,Faddressed directly with patients and
OL,13,Fcarers."
